description	"Ven Zallow

A legendary human Jedi Master utilizing blindingly fast lightsaber swings and disorienting strikes to fell their foes.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Fast/Cyan)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- 80 Base Saber Damage
-- Blinds Enemies on Hit
-- 200% Spec Dmg mult
-- Saber Throw (1) ^3[CS1]

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (1) 
- Sense (1)
- Protect (1) ^3[CS4]
- Speed (3) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
